	(text "Mounting: D-sub pins at the board edge (bottom). J5/J6 are the optional analogue-sense (M5) port:\nthe 82k/10k dividers, 4 x CD74HC4067 and the buffer live on a separate daughter board (not designed here),\nbecause a populated divider ties GND_F to GND_M and so bypasses the isolation barrier. Leave J5/J6 empty for normal use."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 640 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
